WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.254
The takeaway: models combine two skills only when
they act on separate parts of the input.

00:00:06.334 --> 00:00:11.111
When a task needs genuinely chained, multi-step
reasoning, they fail,

00:00:11.191 --> 00:00:13.292
and more parameters won't help.

00:00:13.372 --> 00:00:16.530
Task structure predicts whether scaling helps.
